      "row_index_0based": 7,
      "serialized_row_index": 7,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "島を巡回していた僕は、偶然現れた\nモンスターの一団と遭遇してしまった。\nしかし、幸運なことにロトーナさんが同行しており……。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "d6f16a58600bede08a9c57ae5ac2a5502e613eecbc0ec6565a4e95309ea8904e",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "せやぁっ！\n獣風情が、私に勝てると思っているのか？\n切り刻まれたくなければ、さっさと去れ！",
      "jp_sha256": "bd805732e761870c3de1ca832525cd59e1cd7060bc8fbae0c1adf11c6ca60a1c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "세얏!\n짐승 따위가 나를 이길 수 있다고 생각하나?\n갈가리 찢기고 싶지 않다면 당장 물러가라!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 15,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "10c133855fe51503e7ed8a24404b243ec8daadf651c290eff51e6e004969c202:000002_4389448280548874571:g0:r14",
      "row_index_0based": 14,
      "serialized_row_index": 14,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ロトーナ",
        "Emt2_Ang",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "せやぁっ！\n獣風情が、私に勝てると思っているのか？\n切り刻まれたくなければ、さっさと去れ！",
        "",
        "ch_10056/R18/10056B0_10056_Nml/10056B0_10056_001",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ロトーナ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": "ch_10056/R18/10056B0_10056_Nml/10056B0_10056_001"
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "74ac7838877d65463ae556d74dbea3f8ae97aabc5ab02e4c68790305bfd90639",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 2,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "ロトーナさんの活躍により、あっさり切り抜けたのだった。\n何だかんだ言って、こういう時は頼りになる人なのである。",
      "jp_sha256": "8f603c30d2239c2b58d32f6e3264f39557c35562e4e4fea3261c0df5e99a60e0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "로토나 씨의 활약으로 손쉽게 위기를 벗어났다.\n이래저래 말은 많아도 이럴 때는 믿음직한 사람이다.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "10c133855fe51503e7ed8a24404b243ec8daadf651c290eff51e6e004969c202:000002_4389448280548874571:g0:r16",
      "row_index_0based": 16,
      "serialized_row_index": 16,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "ロトーナさんの活躍により、あっさり切り抜けたのだった。\n何だかんだ言って、こういう時は頼りになる人なのである。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "57f6859df4888c3e999c410a7ccea51c3e32a3edba8e890fbb54e40aa9de26c3",
