      "grid_message_index_0based": 3,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "は、はぁ……。\nご主人様、そういったモノローグ的なアレを\n口に出されると、非常に恥ずかしいのだが……。",
      "jp_sha256": "184342973a2fe3d75e5a2884f385b10ca021478cac015118d0e7d352c7a5f39c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하, 하아…….\n주인님, 그런 독백 같은 것을\n입 밖으로 내시면 몹시 부끄러운데…….",
      "message_index_0based": 3,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b003-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "10c133855fe51503e7ed8a24404b243ec8daadf651c290eff51e6e004969c202:000002_4389448280548874571:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "ロトーナ",
        "Emt8_Shy",
        "layer_中",
        "",
        "",
        "0.3",
        "",
        "は、はぁ……。\nご主人様、そういったモノローグ的なアレを\n口に出されると、非常に恥ずかしいのだが……。",
        "",
        "ch_10056/R18/10056B0_10056_Nml/10056B0_10056_002",
        "",
        ""
      ],
      "speaker": "ロトーナ",
      "translation_status": "translated",
