      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "10c133855fe51503e7ed8a24404b243ec8daadf651c290eff51e6e004969c202:000002_4389448280548874571:g0:r19",
      "row_index_0based": 19,
      "serialized_row_index": 19,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "あはは……すみません、驚いたのでつい。\nでも、本当にありがとうございます。\nロトーナさんが一緒じゃなきゃ危ないところでした。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "66bdced420b226efbdc6faebfe4775a0ff506a8d0cb3df08375b7e197d16c0e9",
